OL,3,CWoman threatened with screwdriver
OL,4,Cduring armed robbery in Carrickfergus
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman
OL,7,Fhad a screwdriver held to her throat
OL,8,Fduring an armed robbery in
OL,9,FCarrickfergus.
OL,11,FThe "terrifying ordeal" occurred at an
OL,12,Foff-licence on Friday evening when a
OL,13,Fman reportedly entered the shop and
OL,14,Fgrabbed a female member of staff,
OL,15,Fthreatening her with a pointed item
OL,16,Fand demanding cash.
OL,26,@sD@EOUsD@WO]
