OL,3,CWoman threatened with screwdriver
OL,4,Cduring armed robbery in Carrickfergus
OL,6,FPolice said she was then forced into
OL,7,Fthe back of the store and she and a
OL,8,Fcolleague were made to obtain cash,
OL,9,Fwhile the man began punching and
OL,10,Fkicking the male member of staff.
OL,12,FThe man working in the shop was then
OL,13,Fstabbed in the side with the
OL,14,Fscrewdriver before both staff members
OL,15,Fwere able to escape while the attacker
OL,16,Fwas distracted.
OL,18,FA PSNI spokesperson said: "Our local
OL,19,Fpolicing team flooded the area.
OL,26,@zD@[OU
