CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F419A1785779368
OL,3,CWoman threatened with screwdriver
OL,4,Cduring armed robbery in Carrickfergus
OL,6,F"After they spotted a man nearby who
OL,7,Fmatched the description provided by
OL,8,Fstaff, a foot chase ensued. When
OL,9,Fofficers caught up with the man, a
OL,10,Fstruggle followed during which an
OL,11,Fofficer was punched, before the man
OL,12,Fwas detained.
OL,14,F"The 34-year-old was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of offences including
OL,16,Frobbery, two counts of assault on
OL,17,Fpolice, aggravated burglary, two
OL,18,Fcounts of common assault and false
OL,19,Fimprisonment.
OL,21,F"He remains in custody at this time."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU}D@AOU}D@eO]
