OL,6,FThey added: "Our detectives will now
OL,7,Ftake this investigation forward, but
OL,8,Fthis was great work by the response
OL,9,Fofficers who found the suspect so
OL,10,Fquickly.
OL,12,F"This was a terrifying ordeal for the
OL,13,Foff-licence staff, who showed great
OL,14,Fpresence of mind in being able to
OL,15,Fescape from the store.
OL,17,F"We're relieved that, although shaken,
OL,18,Fby their experience, neither sustained
OL,19,Fserious injury.
OL,26,@nD@MOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
